d"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"IndiGo's closing fleet included three A321 freighters and seven damp-leased aircraft comprising six B787s and one A321.","quote":"^Includes 3 A321 freighters and 7 Damp leases (6 B787 & 1 A321) **During Q1’27, provided services to 97 additional international destinations through strategic partnerships","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Indigo1_23072026154339_EarningsPresentation_23072026.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"IndiGo incurred net foreign exchange and hedging losses of 1,499 million rupees for the quarter ended June 2026 compared with 237 million rupees in the quarter ended June 2025.","quote":"# Net of Forex loss, loss on forex hedging of INR 1,499 million and INR 237 million for quarter ended Jun’26 and Jun’25 respectively","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Indigo1_23072026154339_EarningsPresentation_23072026.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Revenue environment improved significantly on a year-over-year basis driven by pricing actions and healthy load factors.","quote":"Revenue environment improved meaningfully on a year-on-year basis, supported by pricing actions, healthy loads and a base effect","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Indigo1_29072026150324_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"IndiGo recorded a net loss of 2.4 billion rupees for the quarter compared to a net profit of 21.8 billion rupees a year ago.","quote":"For the quarter we reported a net loss of 2.4 billion rupees compared to a profit of 21.8 billion rupees in the same quarter last year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Indigo1_29072026150324_Transcript.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"IndiGo anticipates flat year-over-year capacity growth